sh text or logos appear on the packaging.\n\nTop-right panel: A three-quarter view of an open pop-up paper book. Intricate layers of paper fold out from the spine and pages to create a miniature stage of Jinan. Visible are the cut edges, overlapping paper planes, and folded structures forming the city's landmarks. The lighting is soft, with a palette of sage green, warm blush pink, and neutral paper tones, accented by subtle thematic colors. The scene is purely handcrafted paper art, avoiding any photographic elements or glass. The composition is a delicate, readable tableau.\n\nMiddle-left panel: A low-angle macro view of a warm beige scroll unrolling in the foreground. The left edge shows the thickness of the rolled paper. The surface supports a raised miniature landscape made of felt and fabric. Soft, rounded fiber trees, textured terrain, and tiny paths lead to a felt representation of Jinan's historic structures, such as the Daming Lake pavilions. Warm natural light illuminates the scene, with a softly blurred background. The focus is on the tactile, handmade quality of the felt and fabric elements.\n\nMiddle-right panel: A clear, brand-less transparent essence bottle, centered and magnified. Inside, a miniature theater stage floats in the clear liquid. The liquid acts as a reflective pool, supporting a stage with an archway, miniature roses or local plants, velvet seating, and railings. A tiny adult conductor and a few musicians are visible, performing with instruments appropriate to Jinan's cultural heritage. The lighting is soft and side-lit, with champagne gold and blush rose tones. Droplets cascade from the bottle's rim. The scene is a detailed, intricate micro-world within the bottle, not a simple coastal view.\n\nBottom-left panel: An open, worn vintage matchbox resting on a dark wooden table. The outer sleeve and inner tray are visible. A miniature Jinan scene rises from the inner tray, supported entirely by the box's base. Tiny streets, trees, and figures are depicted with realistic model materials. A single glowing ember from a scattered match provides warm, cinematic light. The scene includes a bridge or structure, with its supports and foundations entirely contained within the matchbox's inner tray, not extending onto the table. The matchbox shows realistic wear, scratches, and travel marks.\n\nBottom-right panel: A complete, high-quality textile miniature model viewed from a slanted mid-range angle. The entire model, including the base fabric edges, foreground entrance, and main landmark tops, fits within the panel. The scene is constructed from knitted yarn, felt, embroidery, and plush materials. The architecture of Jinan, such as its traditional rooftops and towers, appears as layered fabric pieces with visible stitch marks, knit textures, and soft, rounded forms. The palette consists of warm neutral tones with local accent colors. Soft natural light casts gentle shadows against a simple, soft-colored background. Tiny yarn dolls represent figures, avoiding realistic human photos.", "audio": [], "video": [], "type": "STRING"}, "Node name for S&R": "GoohaiDisplayAny"}, "order": 8, "widgets_values_named": {"gh_input_type": "STRING"}}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "正面文本", "links": [85], "label": "正面文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "正面文本"}, {"name": "额外要求", "links": [86], "label": "额外要求", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "额外要求"}, {"name": "宽度", "label": "宽度", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "宽度"}, {"name": "高度", "label": "高度", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "高度"}, {"name": "潜空间", "links": [110], "label": "潜空间", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "潜空间"}], "size": [400, 390], "pos": [-1075.946796653459, 777.6588155941985], "widgets_values": ["济南", "", "3:4 (竖版标准)", 1, 1, 32, "[]", false, false], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "positive_prompt"}, "name": "positive_prompt", "label": "positive_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}, {"widget": {"name": "extra_requirements"}